---LINES
var     = pvi   -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
vari    = pvix  -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
varc    = pvix  -       -       -       -         "        " 
alt1    = paix  -       -       -       -         "YES"
a2      = aix   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipmx  -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm - - - - " MSE "

common  = g  - - - - " common: "
page_n  = g  - - - - " page navigation: "
specia  = g  - - - - " special: "

---SCREEN                                                          
=LINLIB generic keyboard commands/actions
                                                                              
+.common...............             .VAR. - editing            .var.....      
+   .:HE... get help                    .:SP... keep content   .vari....         
+   .:RE... refresh page                .:DE... clear field    .varc....        
+   .:EX... exit/close page                                                      
+   .:CA... cancel                  .ALT. - alter or toggle    .a2            
+   .:TA... next line                   .:SP... forward item                      
+                                       .:DE... backward item                     
+.page_n...............                                                          
+   .:KH... jump to 1st line        .MSE. - select menu item:  .mse.....      
+   .:KE... jump to last line           .:SP... or .:NL...            
+   .:PD... next page/part                                                        
+   .:PU... prev page/part      ."in edit mode"................. ."with prefix".  
+                               .:DE... erase left from cursor               
+.specia...............         .:KD... erase below cursor       .:PR .:DE...	   
+   .:NL... next line,                         erase up to end   .:PR .:SP...    
+           commit,complete     .:KH... jump to 1st symbol       .:PR .:AL...    
+   .:PR... option prefix       .:KE... jump to end of text      .:PR .:AR...    
+                               .:KI... toggle Ins/Ovr mode      .:PR .:PR...    
+                               
=LINLIB (c) 1986-1990,2020 vsv&team
---END                          

+."common"..........            .MSE.   .mse..... -------select menu item:
+."page navigation".            .VAR.   .var..... --------switch to edit: 
+."special".........                erase below cursor:  .:KD...  .:PR .:DE...
